    family-names: de Kort
    affiliation: University of Aruba / DCDC Network
    orcid: 'https://orcid.org/0009-0006-5402-0500'
abstract: >-
  The Curacao edition of Introduction to R for SPSS Users, a hands-on
  workshop for researchers, students, and institutional staff who
  currently use SPSS and want to transition to R. The course maps
  common SPSS workflows to R equivalents, covering data manipulation
  with tidyverse, visualization with ggplot2, statistical analysis,
  and reproducible reporting with R Markdown. Teaching examples are
  drawn from the squad composition of the four ABC island national
  football teams and from FIFA ranking and diaspora data. Developed
  by the DCDC Network as open educational materials.
